      "title": "Uncontrolled Resource Consumption in com.nimbusds:nimbus-jose-jwt",
      "description": "Affected versions of com.nimbusds:nimbus-jose-jwt are vulnerable to Allocation of Resources Without Limits or Throttling / Uncontrolled Resource Consumption. A denial-of-service vulnerability exists in Nimbus JOSE+JWT\u2019s PBKDF2-based decryption. An attacker can supply an excessively large iteration count via the JWE p2c header, triggering extreme resource consumption during decryption.",
